flowchart TD
SimulationModel["**Simulation Model**
Constructs production system
Runs simulation and returns KPIs throughput and wip"]
DelayBuffer["**Delay Buffer**
Attributes cap delay store tokens
Methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
Machine["**Machine**
Attributes name process time availability mttr power capacity metrics
Methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy working_energy reset_stats"]
RunSimCaps["**Run Simulation With Caps**
Wrapper that builds model with provided buffer capacities
Returns KPI dictionary for a run"]
EvaluateInd["**Evaluate Single Individual**
Runs multiple replications for one capacity vector
Aggregates avg wip and avg throughput"]
BufferProblem["**Buffer Capacity Problem**
Decision variables 6 integer buffer caps {1-10}
Evaluates population and produces objective values"]
ParallelEval["**Parallel Evaluator**
Uses multiprocessing Pool for parallel evaluation
Maps individuals to Evaluate Single Individual"]
NSGA2Opt["**NSGA II Optimizer**
Configures sampling crossover mutation termination
Minimizes Buffer Capacity Problem to produce Pareto set"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**
Six buffer capacities
Integer range {1-10} each"]
Objectives["**Objectives**
Minimize wip
Maximize throughput implemented as negative objective"]
CSVExporter["**CSV Exporter**
Exports history of generations solutions and KPIs to CSV"]
Main["**Main**
Sets multiprocessing start method
Runs optimizer and exports results"]

SimulationModel --> Machine
SimulationModel --> DelayBuffer
RunSimCaps --> SimulationModel
EvaluateInd --> RunSimCaps
DecisionVars --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> ParallelEval
ParallelEval --> EvaluateInd
EvaluateInd --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Opt
NSGA2Opt --> CSVExporter
Main --> NSGA2Opt
Main --> CSVExporter
DecisionVars --> NSGA2Opt
Objectives --> NSGA2Opt